### npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt  (513 textos)
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#1 (mes)
- "- You may proceed after reaching level 145 or over -"
+ "- Você pode prosseguir depois de chegar ao nível 145 ou mais -"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#2 (mes)
- "[Professor Bernhard]"
+ "[Professor Bernhard]"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#3 (mes)
- "I would say I am Professor Bernhard, the best weapons researcher in Schwarzwald."
+ "Eu diria que sou o Professor Bernhard, o melhor pesquisador de armas de Schwarzwald."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#4 (mes)
- "[Professor Bernhard]"
+ "[Professor Bernhard]"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#5 (mes)
- "After endless research I have created various weapons, but I felt something was missing so I found the ancient texts."
+ "Depois de uma pesquisa sem fim eu criei várias armas, mas eu sentia que faltava alguma coisa, e então achei os textos antigos."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#6 (mes)
- "I found out about the Dimensional Device during my research."
+ "Foi durante a minha pesquisa que eu descobri o Dispositivo Dimensional."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#7 (mes)
- "[Professor Bernhard]"
+ "[Professor Bernhard]"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#8 (mes)
- "I also realized that relics from the glorious past were also needed to create more powerful and superior weapons."
+ "Também percebi que relíquias do passado glorioso eram necessárias para criar armas mais poderosas e superiores."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#9 (mes)
- "That is why..I need you.."
+ "É por isso que..eu preciso de você.."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#10 (mes)
- "[Professor Bernhard]"
+ "[Professor Bernhard]"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#11 (mes)
- "A longing for accomplishing a powerful weapon as a genuine professor!"
+ "O desejo de concluir uma arma poderosa, como um professor de verdade!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#12 (mes)
- "In order to accomplish that, we need shards of Gigantes that once appeared in the past battle of Fenrir and Sarah."
+ "Para conseguir isso, nós precisamos de fragmentos dos Gigantes que apareceram na antiga batalha de Fenrir e Sarah."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#13 (mes)
- "[Professor Bernhard]"
+ "[Professor Bernhard]"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#14 (mes)
- "I cannot leave my post."
+ "Eu não posso deixar o meu posto."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#15 (mes)
