- "You seem capable."
+ "Você parece capaz."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#21 (mes)
- "[Professor Bernhard]"
+ "[Professor Bernhard]"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#22 (mes)
- "What do you think?"
+ "O que você acha?"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#23 (mes)
- "Would you go to the past and bring me back the shards of Gigantes?"
+ "Você iria ao passado e me traria os fragmentos dos Gigantes?"
