#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#258 (unittalk)
- " : Huh? Somebody there? Hello~ You must be a traveler."
+ " : Hein? Tem alguém aí? Olá~ Você deve ser um viajante."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#259 (cutin)
- "fenrir_a.bmp"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#260 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: This is strange.. I don't recall Glast Heim castle being filled with such a dark presence.."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Que estranho.. Eu não me lembro do castelo de Glast Heim tomado por uma presença tão escura.."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#261 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Greetings can come later! Careful! It seems somebody has summoned a monster!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: As saudações ficam para depois! Cuidado! Parece que alguém invocou um monstro!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#264 (atrib)
- "::OnMobDead"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#275 (unittalk)
- " : What are these things?"
+ " : O que são essas coisas?"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#276 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Buy me some time while I cast magic! I will handle this!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Ganhe tempo para mim enquanto eu conjuro! Eu cuido disso!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#283 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Wrath of the true sky."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Ira do verdadeiro céu."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#284 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Thunderbolt that may split the earth!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Raio capaz de rachar a terra!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#285 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Fall before me now!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Caia diante de mim agora!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#286 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Aaah!! Thunder Storm!!!!!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Aaah!! Tempestade de Raios!!!!!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#290 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Glast Heim, once the cathedral for the Asgard gods.."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Glast Heim, um dia a catedral dos deuses de Asgard.."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#291 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Now it has completely become a habitat for monsters.."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Agora virou de vez um covil de monstros.."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#292 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Wait.. Come to think of it, something is strange.."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Espere.. Pensando bem, tem uma coisa estranha.."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#293 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Galions are the monsters that habit this vicinity.."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Os Galion é que são os monstros que habitam esta região.."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#296 (cutin)
- "fenrir_a.bmp"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#297 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: By the way, I know it was sudden but thank you for helping."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Aliás, eu sei que foi repentino, mas obrigado pela ajuda."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#298 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Anyway, who are you?"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Enfim, quem é você?"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#300 (unittalk)
- " : Ah.. that is...."
+ " : Ah.. é que...."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#302 (unittalk)
- " : .. I am a traveler who wanders around the world!"
+ " : .. Eu sou um viajante que perambula pelo mundo!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#303 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Is that so..? I see.. I guess it does not matter."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: É mesmo..? Entendo.. Acho que não faz diferença."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#304 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: This place seems quite dangerous now. It is not too late to turn back."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Este lugar parece bem perigoso agora. Não é tarde demais para voltar."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#305 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: There is an object I need to find. I need to hurry before it is too late."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Há um objeto que eu preciso achar. Eu preciso me apressar antes que seja tarde."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#306 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Perhaps you can help me..."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Talvez você possa me ajudar..."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#307 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: No.. Then thank you! I hope we can meet again later!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Não.. Então obrigado! Espero que a gente se encontre de novo!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#310 (unittalk)
- " : Did that.. person.. really happen to be.. the.. Fenrir..? No way.. probably not.."
+ " : Será que.. aquela pessoa.. era mesmo.. o.. Fenrir..? Que nada.. provavelmente não.."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#315 (npctalk)
- "Sarah Irene: Impressive Fenrith Fenrir, you cleverly escaped"
+ "Sarah Irene: Impressionante, Fenrith Fenrir, você escapou com esperteza"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#316 (npctalk)
- "Sarah Irene: Mm.. today I will make you stand down"
+ "Sarah Irene: Mm.. hoje eu faço você recuar"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#317 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Today I hope to end our ill fated relationship."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Hoje eu espero encerrar a nossa relação maldita."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#318 (npctalk)
- "Sarah Irene: However, do not think this is the end"
+ "Sarah Irene: Mas não pense que isto é o fim"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#319 (npctalk)
- "Sarah Irene: You will surely see me again!!!"
+ "Sarah Irene: Você com certeza vai me ver de novo!!!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#320 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Mm... I look forward to it Sarah Irene.."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Mm... Fico no aguardo, Sarah Irene.."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#324 (cutin)
- "fenrir_a.bmp"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#325 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: You are still in Glast Heim? Why aren't you leaving this dangerous place?"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Você ainda está em Glast Heim? Por que não sai deste lugar perigoso?"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#327 (unittalk)
- " : I know it's dangerous but I thought it would be fun so I couldn't help myself.."
+ " : Eu sei que é perigoso, mas achei que ia ser divertido e não resisti.."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#328 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Hm.. Adventurers.."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Hm.. Aventureiros.."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#330 (unittalk)
- " : You don't have to worry~! I am fairly strong myself!"
+ " : Você não precisa se preocupar~! Eu sou bem forte!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#331 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Oh.. really? Do you think you can assist me then?"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Ah.. é mesmo? Então você acha que pode me ajudar?"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#332 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: The object I am looking for is located somewhere in Glast Heim!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: O objeto que eu procuro está em algum lugar de Glast Heim!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#333 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: But others looking for the object will arrive there soon!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Mas outros que procuram o objeto chegam lá logo!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#334 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: This is urgent because there isn't enough time. We have to arrive there soon. 5 minutes at the latest!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Isto é urgente porque não há tempo suficiente. Nós temos que chegar lá logo. Em 5 minutos, no máximo!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#335 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: I will be waiting! If you are late I will have to go by myself!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Eu vou esperar! Se você atrasar, eu vou ter que ir sozinho!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#336 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Alright, I will go on ahead and you decide if you are going to assist me!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Muito bem, eu vou na frente e você decide se vai me ajudar!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#339 (unittalk)
- " : Hm.. what should I do..? I need shards of Gigantes as requested by Professor Bernhard.."
+ " : Hm.. o que eu faço..? Eu preciso de fragmentos dos Gigantes, como o Professor Bernhard pediu.."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#341 (unittalk)
- " : Should I help that person.. Or should I look for Gigantes to take the shards as requested by Professor Bernhard..?"
+ " : Eu ajudo aquela pessoa.. Ou eu procuro os Gigantes para tirar os fragmentos, como o Professor Bernhard pediu..?"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#347 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: I would like your party leader to come and help me!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Eu gostaria que o líder do seu grupo viesse me ajudar!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#349 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: You came! I was waiting!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Você veio! Eu estava esperando!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#350 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: We don't have much time! We have to go search for it now! Let's go in!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Não temos muito tempo! Temos que ir procurar agora! Vamos entrar!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#355 (cutin)
- "fenrir_a.bmp"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#356 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: The sword of Baldur, Sentinel Breeze... even after 1000 years.."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: A espada de Baldur, Sentinel Breeze... mesmo depois de 1000 anos.."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#357 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: I can feel the evil of monsters in this place.. as if they are being controlled by someone.."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Eu sinto a maldade dos monstros neste lugar.. como se eles estivessem sendo controlados por alguém.."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#358 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Then there is someone else here other than me?"
