- "Fenrith Fenrir: Come like the silent dawn mist and freeze everything!!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Venha como a névoa silenciosa da madrugada e congele tudo!!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#663 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Appear!!! Frost Misty!!!!!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Apareça!!! Zero Absoluto!!!!!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#666 (unittalk)
- "Sarah Irene: Argh!!! I will kill you all!!!!!!"
