#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#667 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Heaven's sword piercing the sky"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Espada dos céus que perfura o firmamento"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#668 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: I wish to borrow your strength for a moment!!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Eu quero tomar emprestada a sua força por um instante!!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#669 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Let fall here your extreme strength that can tear even the vacuum!!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Deixe cair aqui a sua força extrema, capaz de rasgar até o vácuo!!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#682 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Sword that can control life and death, and pierce space time!!!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Espada capaz de controlar a vida e a morte, e de perfurar o espaço-tempo!!!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#683 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Come out Baretis Spear!!!!!!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Venha, Baretis Spear!!!!!!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#686 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Now! I put Sarah in critical condition! You have to finish her off! Attack her quickly! Sarah is strong!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Agora! Eu deixei a Sarah em estado crítico! Vocês têm que acabar com ela! Ataquem depressa! A Sarah é forte!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#687 (mapannounce)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Now! I put Sarah in critical condition! You have to finish her off!! Attack her quickly! Sarah is strong!"
