#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#711 (npctalk)
- "Sarah Irene: Not yet!!"
+ "Sarah Irene: Ainda não!!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#713 (npctalk)
- "Sarah Irene: Hehe... You evade well like a rat."
+ "Sarah Irene: Hehe... Você foge bem, como um rato."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#714 (npctalk)
- "Sarah Irene: However, I cannot let you leave with that."
+ "Sarah Irene: Mas eu não posso deixar você ir embora com isso."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#715 (npctalk)
- "Sarah Irene: I will blow this entire castle away! Yaah!"
+ "Sarah Irene: Eu vou explodir este castelo inteiro! Yaah!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#717 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: She is planning to collapse this place! I must perform a large scale teleportation!!!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Ela pretende derrubar este lugar! Eu preciso fazer um teleporte em larga escala!!!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#719 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Farewell Valkyrie!! I shall take the Sentinel Breeze! So long!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Adeus, Valquíria!! Eu levo a Sentinel Breeze! Até mais!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#727 (cutin)
- "fenrir_b.bmp"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#728 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Hehe.. You are certainly skilled but I think you have underestimated me, Valkyrie."
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Hehe.. Você é habilidosa mesmo, mas eu acho que me subestimou, Valquíria."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#729 (mapannounce)
- "Sarah Irene: You rather entertain me Fenrith..."
+ "Sarah Irene: Você até que me diverte, Fenrith..."
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#730 (mapannounce)
- "Sarah Irene: Did you think you can escape that easily?"
+ "Sarah Irene: Você achou que podia escapar assim tão fácil?"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#731 (mapannounce)
- "Sarah Irene: I shall turn Glast Heim into hell!!"
+ "Sarah Irene: Eu vou transformar Glast Heim num inferno!!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#732 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: If we don't escape now we will suffer a gruesome fate by Sarah's monsters and magic!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Se não escaparmos agora, vamos ter um fim horrível pelas mãos dos monstros e da magia da Sarah!"
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#733 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Let's meet at Glast Heim entrance where we first met! If we flee that far it should be safe!"
+ "Fenrith Fenrir: Vamos nos encontrar na entrada de Glast Heim, onde nos vimos pela primeira vez! Se fugirmos até lá, deve ser seguro!"
